li-js.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-js[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Period stats strips with a Roots chart, a Types chart, and a [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]working switch[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Every week, quarter, year, and all-time note heads with a calm, [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]honest strip: the facts, then a Roots chart (top N root parents, N [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]from config, 5 in chezmoi) and a Types chart (configured task types[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]only) on one shared child-period axis, a ●/■ switch that cycles [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Both → Roots → Types with its own memory, identity colors, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]density rules per period kind.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]period_strip_two_charts.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/period_strip_two_charts.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-js[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-js/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fix the current period strip and make colors follow identity[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]strip_polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip_polish: plugin-only fixes on today's strip (legend hues, legend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rank, tick baselines, honest heights, year values, so-far, tooltip [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]labels), isolate period strips from the Day strip switch, and make the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared root/type color passes identity-ordered.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Configured task-type minutes in Stats[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]type_split[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]type_split: add a task_type parts dimension to Pomodoro metrics that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]splits each session's counted minutes over its configured types only, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with unnamed and label-only buckets, plus docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob periods show charts and stacks contract[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]period_charts[dim] · [dim][/dim]after type_split[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]period_charts: parse stats.period_strip.top_roots, emit charts plus [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]per-column and per-child stacks and display_short, fix long-period [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]coverage copy, document the contract, and set top_roots 5 in chezmoi.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Two-chart period strip painter and its own switch[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]chart_painter[dim] · [dim][/dim]after strip_polish, period_charts[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]chart_painter: paint Roots above Types on one shared axis from bob's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]charts and stacks, with legend titles, identity hues, honest geometry, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the period-only switch and command, the older-bob fallback, tests, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]week/quarter previews.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Year and all-time density, parts table, polish, and memory[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]long_periods[dim] · [dim][/dim]after chart_painter[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]long_periods: year and all-time density rules, the measured year [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallback, all-time untracked collapse, parts-table mini-bars, legend [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]hover dimming, forced colors, the full preview matrix, docs, and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]memory updates.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-js","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-js.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-js.1"},"source_run_id":"run-5b568011727627e54d61e589a3ddb0af","started_at":"2026-11-10T16:50:36.060053+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"dba974f2a50e48dc1aa35d5cbf77d58d36818bb6d5795f4f1171260580fc653f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.4--2/chat.md","size_bytes":27590},"commits":{"digest":"7a29d832508affb47382414e8b2f5fd2036eb9048ad4a7be21187c067db01962","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.4--2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"b82d6c9781007587738f86952cd70aba6fd5cdbf7100f96ccfd0dd1aca707414","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.4--2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":64},"meta":{"digest":"d2be3d9cc5b15b7f1ad5ba08525cb3b60f9a421eddc321c51a86374ea839a00c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.4--2/meta.json","size_bytes":661},"prompt":{"digest":"d90ff561984b7938dd1d99c7f94fa636dd976cf2399afac1cfcdd36af38c2a3f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.4--2/prompt.md","size_bytes":6979},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"a23cf19847505a5f431d8eaf3911b0924686a6e341ea1197577755538e494186","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-js.4--2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":2338},"state":{"digest":"72e3c37231b9229ff11d7582f65e348081570a9a434251f